<title>USA: Ricoh says files patent suits.</title>
<headline>Ricoh says files patent suits.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CALDWELL, N.J. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ricoh Co Ltd said and its North American unit Ricoh Corp said Tuesday they filed suit against Color Image Inc, GPI USA Inc and Taiwan-based GPI Co Ltd for patent infringement and unfair competition.</p>
<p>Ricoh said the suit, filed in federal court in Delaware, is based on the defendants' manufacture and sale of cleaner toner magazines for Ricoh-manufactured facsimile products.</p>
<p>A Color Image spokesman declined to comment on the suit and GPI representatives could not be reached for comment.  </p>
<p>In April, Ricoh announced it had won a similar suit against Nashua Corp. It said it has also won a similar ruling against a unit of Nu-Kote Holdings Inc.</p>
